google.visualization.Query.setResponse({"version":"0.6","reqId":"0","status":"ok","sig":"1206859120","table":{"cols":[{"id":"A","label":"","type":"string"},{"id":"B","label":"","type":"string"}],"rows":[{"c":[null,{"v":"🎯 Purpose of the EROOM Optimization Framework"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"This diagnosis evaluates the maturity of a digital service to identify its key optimisation levers - algorithm, code, architecture, operations, data, hosting, etc."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Each question focuses on a factor influencing performance, efficiency, or maintainability."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The diagnosis is not a performance grade - it helps prioritize where to act first. There are no \u201Cgood\u201D or \u201Cbad\u201D scores, only opportunities for improvement."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"📊 Scoring Scale"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"For each criterion, assign a score from 1 to 5 based on the current level of mastery."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"1 = not mastered / unknown"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"5 = mastered and measured"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Each question contributes equally to the overall score, which is then converted into a percentage of optimization potential (0%\u2013100%)."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"This percentage reflects how much room for improvement remains for the service."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"🧮 Score Interpretation"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The total score is expressed as a percentage of optimization potential."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"\u2022 High percentage → strong potential for improvement (technical, organizational, or environmental)."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"\u2022 Low percentage → already mature or efficient service."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The diagnosis does not assign a performance grade."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"It is designed to prioritise actions and identify where improvement efforts will have the most impact."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"There are no \u201Cgood\u201D or \u201Cbad\u201D results - only opportunities to act."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"💡 For who?"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The EROOM quick diagnosis is designed to be lightweight and accessible, but it requires a minimum understanding of the technical context."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"It can be carried out by:"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"\u2022 someone familiar with the technical environment, able to assess the maturity of current practices;"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"\u2022 a tech\u2013product duo, to cross perspectives and ensure alignment between technical and functional priorities;"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"\u2022 an external consultant, as part of an audit or Green IT assessment."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"💡 How to Use"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"A diagnosis corresponds to a single digital service."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"An organisation can therefore perform several quick diagnoses to build a complete map of its information system and identify where to act first."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 1 - Duplicate the file"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The tool is provided as a Google Sheets spreadsheet."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Start by duplicating the file for your own use so you can enter your answers without modifying the original template."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 2 - Identify the scope"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The diagnosis is performed for a digital service, a platform, or the entire IS."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Each evaluated service should have its own dedicated sheet."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 4 - Answer the questions - 0 - Quick Diagnosis"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Assign a score from 1 to 5 for each question, based on the available information."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"1 = not mastered / unknown"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"5 = mastered, measured, optimised"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"When uncertain, select 1 (\u201CI don\u2019t know\u201D) or choose a conservative score, and note the point to clarify later."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"You can ignore any criteria by setting its Weight to \u201CNot Applicable\u201D."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"If the Quick Diagnosis score is very low, there is no need to continue with the detailed steps. The optimisation potential is either already low or too difficult to reach, so it is more efficient to focus on other services."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 5 - Answer the questions - 1 - Product to  - 5 - Algo&Code"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"✅ Strength confirmed = already addressed, no potential of improvement left."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"💡 Improvement potential identified = not fully addressed, significant room for improvement remains."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"You can ignore any criteria by setting its Weight to \u201CNot Applicable\u201D."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 6 - Answer the questions - 6 - Ease of change"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"🟢 Easy to change = can be updated with minimal obstacles."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"🟡 Moderate effort = bring change would be an achievable challenge."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"🔴 Hard to change = implementing change would be difficult."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"You can ignore any criteria by setting its Weight to \u201CNot Applicable\u201D."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 7 - Collaborate across roles"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Complete the diagnosis with technical, product, and sustainability (RSE) representatives to build a shared understanding, not to grade the teams."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The goal is to create a shared understanding, not to assign a performance grade."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Low score → mature, already efficient service."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"High score → strong potential for optimisation (technical, organisational, or environmental)."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 7 - Use the results"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Compare the results across services."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Those with the highest scores become the priority candidates for deeper analysis within the EROOM framework."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"License CC-BY-SA"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"This license enables reusers to distribute, remix, adapt, and build upon the material in any medium or format, so long as attribution is given to the creator. \nThe license allows for commercial use. If you remix, adapt, or build upon the material, you must license the modified material under identical terms."}]},{"c":[nu